5,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I need to know if the yard equipment can handle the new system without breaking.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,I am worried about the hidden costs that appear after the initial contract is signed.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Asuka,,Who is actually responsible when the system fails during a critical operation?,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to see how our old systems aged and what went wrong with past upgrades.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,I am concerned about the people who will have to learn and maintain this new system.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Mizuki, if the price goes up later, does that affect the yard operations?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Kenji, yes, if the budget is cut, support for your equipment might be delayed.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Rin, knowing the history of failures helps us avoid repeating the same mistakes.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, exactly. I want to see the upgrade history of the dispatch tool.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@All, we must consider the human cost of change, not just the technical one.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I will look into the yard devices and the depot calendar.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,I will check the board minutes and the renewal invoices.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I will investigate the support ownership and the warehouse rule changes.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Rin,,I will look at the upgrade history and the data lift from 2018.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Servas,,I will examine the administrator retirements and the depot supervisors' experience.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
