35,2,1,talk,Kenji,,"The yard devices are old, and the 2021 trial failed quickly. We need a system that works with them.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,"@Asuka, the invoices show that separate licenses keep climbing in price. Bundled deals stay flat.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"@Mizuki, that confirms my fear. The scope changes constantly, and support is fragmented.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Rin,,"@All, the dispatch tool skipped three upgrades because testing took too long. The 2018 data lift was a mess.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Servas,,"@All, two admins are retiring, and the supervisors ignored the last training. We are losing our knowledge base.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Rin, if the dispatch tool is so hard to upgrade, how do we handle a new system?","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Kenji, we need a vendor who includes maintenance in the base price, not as an add-on.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Mizuki, I agree. But we also need clear ownership. No more pointing fingers during outages.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, the 2018 data lift took a year to fix. We need a vendor who handles data migration well.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@All, if the supervisors ignore the training, the system will fail. We need a vendor who works with our people.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Servas, the depot calendar is tight. We can't afford a long cutover period.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@Kenji, a subscription model might be safer for the budget, but we need to check the terms.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Mizuki, I am leaning towards a vendor who provides a single point of contact for support.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, I am worried about the data migration. The 2018 experience was terrible.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Servas,,"@All, we need a vendor who will stay with us through the rollout, not just hand over the keys.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
